  <p>ali aa gae..(4)</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai.....3</p> 
  <p>zindagi bandagi roshni aagai,<br> roshni aagai aagai aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>1. Maut inke muhibbon ko aati nahi,<br> aa bhi jae to phir bach ke jaati nahi<br> maut ka kya khatar maut se kya hai darr,<br> is se bach na bhi kya aagai aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagae</p> 
  <p>2. Teri masnad pe gairon ko bithla diya,<br> warise mustafa mazhar e kibriya<br> tu ali o wasi o wali hi raha,<br> manzilat me teri kya kami aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>3. Hum ke sarsar ishk o tawalla me the,<br> jaante hi na the nafraton dushmani<br> yeh tabarrah bhi wallah&nbsp; kya cheez hai,<br> hum ko aghyar se dushmani aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>4. Maslak e ishk me maangna ayb hai,<br> mai bhi khamoosh hun woh bhi khamosh hai<br> unko sub hai khabar isliye chup hun mai,<br> kya hua aankh me gar nami aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>5. Khums dena mawaddat ki ek shart hai,<br> aur na dena bhi misle fidak hai gunah<br> hak ke saadat zehra ke makrooz se,<br> jab tabarra suna to hasi aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>6. kyun na roe woh kismat ko apni sada,<br> jin ka pura mukaddar hai lanat zada<br> jin ki kismat me apne hi aamal se<br> binte ahmad ki naarazgi aa gai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>7. Sura e aale imran bhi hai gawah,<br> misle kausar hui aal unko ata<br> woh jo kehte the abtar nabi ko mere<br> unki kismat me hi abtari aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>8. Ishq e haider me phirte the shaam o sahar,<br> unke maddah hai sare jin o bashar<br> unki aawargi ka safar dekh kar,<br> zahn me fikr e aawargi aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
  <p>9. Shairi ki sharaet bata bhi gae<br> aur maye ishk e haidar pila bhi gae<br> sibte jafar mai qurban tere ishk ke<br> ibne jaafar ko bhi shairi aagai</p> 
  <p>jab khuda ko pukara ali aagae,<br> jab ali aagae zindagi aagai</p> 
